{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>Peoples — the mountain they will call.</b> Issachar and Zebulun will call the nations of the world to the good mountain, through the varieties of their merchandise that are not found among the nations." "<b>There they will offer sacrifices of righteousness.</b> Also the merchants of the nations who would offer their sacrifices to the sun and the moon — when they come to the good mountain, they will offer there sacrifices of righteousness." "<b>For the abundance of the seas they will suck.</b> Issachar and Zebulun will have varieties of merchandise that come from the sea, including those that are hidden and buried in the sand — like the blood of the ḥillazon and white glass in the sandglass found in sand."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {2 "חולסית שבחול is rendered 'sandglass found in sand'; the term refers to a vitreous substance or gemstone formed in sand. The exact identification is uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:37.846200348Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}